SUMMARY:Mount Vernon Trail Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this point to point hike\, the next in our 911 National Memori
 al Trail series\, this with the Mt Vernon Trail being the subject. The off
 icial trail map shows this as a part of it\, as a spur.\nThe trail is just
  over 17 miles\, so it fits perfectly what we do\, and after this one we'l
 l start heading back toward NYC.\nAfter meeting at the end point\, we'll s
 huttle with as few vehicles as possible to our start point.\nThe Mt Vernon
  Trail is pretty straightforward\, and follows the Potomac River the entir
 e time\, so it's really a great continuation from what we've already done 
 with the C&O.\nThis time I'm only planning on one day of hiking\, and migh
 t visit some museums the second day.\nIf needed\, contact me at 908 343 83
 74
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/316823217/
